1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,109
Inside, a mass of nutritive tissue, the nucellus, wrapped in one or two integuments.

2
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:11,119
They leave a narrow pore at one end, the micropyle.

3
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:13,867
The opposite end, the base, is the chalaza.

4
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:17,356
And deep in the nucellus sits the embryo sac.

